    "notes": "Espressif's user guide lists six ordering codes: ESP32-S2-DevKitM-1-N4R2 (ESP32-S2-MINI-2, 4 MB flash, 2 MB PSRAM, PCB antenna), ESP32-S2-DevKitM-1 (EOL, ESP32-S2-MINI-1, 4 MB, no PSRAM, PCB antenna), ESP32-S2-DevKitM-1R (EOL, MINI-1, 4 MB, 2 MB PSRAM, PCB antenna), and the -1U/-1U-N4R2/-1RU counterparts with an external antenna connector (MINI-1U/MINI-2U). The record covers the PCB-antenna DevKitM-1 board; the U (external antenna) SKUs stay distinct and must not be authored under this id. PSRAM differs between PCB-antenna variants (0 or 2 MB), so psram_mb is omitted. Distinct from catalogued esp32-s2-devkitc-1 (SOLO/WROOM module, 8 MB flash) and esp32-s2-saola-1.",
